        {
          "text": "Pele Joshua mwana wa-Nuni kazwide muuya wabusongo, nkaambo Musa wakabika maanza alinguwe, aboobo bana ba-Israyeli bakamuswiilila akucita mbubonya mbuli Jehova mbwaakalailila Musa. ",
