              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Takunabwenekede umwi uuleene awe muzitondezyo zyoonse amumilimo yoonse iigambya Jehova njaakamutumide kuti aicite munyika ya-Egepita, kuli-Farao akubantu bakwe boonse akunyika yakwe yoonse, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
